                <head>No. 12.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Phelps to the Marquis of
                        Salisbury.—</hi>(<hi rendition="#italic">Received December</hi>
                    31.)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-12-28"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 28,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I have had the honor to receive your
                    lordship’s note of the 24th instant relating to the termination of the mission
                    of Lord Sackville, late minister from Her Majesty’s Government to the United
                    States, and I have transmitted the same to my Government for its
                    consideration.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. J. Phelps.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
